009502"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1009108","name":{"zh":"南中反叛","en":"Nanzhong Rebellion"},"year":"224","month":"12","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国武将。原为牂牁郡丞，刘备入蜀后因南中治理乏力，地方豪强逐渐坐大。孟获叛乱期间随其进攻永昌，被诸葛亮暗中招降的高定部将鄂焕所杀。","tc":"蜀國武將。原為牂牁郡丞，劉備入蜀后因南中治理乏力，地方豪強逐漸坐大。孟獲叛亂期間隨其進攻永昌，被諸葛亮暗中招降的高定部將鄂煥所殺。","en":"An officer of Shu. Originally the deputy administrator of Zangke Commandery. After Liu Bei entered Shu, weak governance over the Nanzhong region allowed local strongmen to grow increasingly powerful. During Meng Huo's rebellion, he followed Meng Huo in attacking Yongchang but was slain by E Huan, a subordinate of Gao Ding who had been secretly recruited by Zhuge Liang.","jp":"蜀の武将。もとは牂牁郡丞であったが、劉備の入蜀後は南中の統治が行き届かなかったため、地方の豪強として次第に勢力を拡大させた。孟獲の反乱に呼応して永昌へ侵攻した際、諸葛亮に密かに帰順した高定の部将・鄂煥によって討ち取られた。","kr":"촉나라의 무장. 본래 장가군승이었으나, 유비가 입촉한 뒤 남중 통치가 소홀해진 틈을 타 지방 호족들이 점차 세력을 키웠다. 맹획이 반란을 일으켰을 때 그를 따라 영창을 공격했으나, 제갈량에게 은밀히 귀순한 고정의 부장 악환에게 목숨을 잃었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10643","remark":"","surname":"朱","surnameTc":"朱","surnameEn":"Zhu","surnameJp":"朱","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"褒","nameTc":"褒","nameEn":"Bao","nameJp":"褒","nameKr":"포","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"朱褒","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"209","city":"CS1042","gender":"0","rule":"68","force":"73","wise":"34","politics":"32","charm":"39","will":"39","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"2","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"50/50/51/50/50/50/50/50","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012005","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4600","battleSoulPo